{"id":"wb-8-204","name":"正定梁氏宗祠","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"正定梁氏宗祠","text":"正定梁氏宗祠位于中国河北省石家庄市正定县正定镇燕赵南大街东侧218号、“正定历史文化街”牌楼附近，其修建可能与梁梦龙及其父梁相有关，现存大门和建于明代晚期的祠堂。2019年10月7日，正定梁氏宗祠公布为第八批全国重点文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E6%AD%A3%E5%AE%9A%E6%A2%81%E6%B0%8F%E5%AE%97%E7%A5%A0","revisionId":91908301,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=91908301","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/6913c65ec21a15545e31311a.jpg","title":"20250118_Ancestral_Hall_of_Liang_Clan_03.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:20250118_Ancestral_Hall_of_Liang_Clan_03.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/9/93/20250118_Ancestral_Hall_of_Liang_Clan_03.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Windmemories","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​正定梁氏宗祠","width":320,"height":213}}